  <h2>{en ? "2. Who can use GlotKids" : "2. GlotKids'i kimler kullanabilir"}</h2>
  {en
    ? <p>GlotKids is made for children aged {SITE.ages}, to be used with the permission and under the supervision of a parent or legal guardian. These Terms are accepted by that adult, who must be of legal age in their country. Everything meant for adults in the app (the account, the parent's area, any purchase) is behind a parental gate and must be done by an adult.</p>
